# `**/.env` does not match `.env.bak` or `.env.local`, and the frontend image
# builds from the repo root with `COPY . .` — so real secrets would land in the
# build stage. The backend reads its configuration from the container
# environment, never a file.
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
